2:T487,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/little-monster-media-movie-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/little-monster-media-movie-voice","headline":"Movie trailer - Little Monster Media","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/little-monster-media-movie-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Guy Harris performed his movie trailer voice for Little Monster Media's big radio imaging and SFX promotion video this year. Click on the link for more!","datePublished":"2018-08-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2018-08-01T00:00:00+00:00","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/little-monster-media-movie-voice.jpg"}}3:T404,<h2>My movie trailer voice for a great radio imaging company!</h2>
<p>I've known and worked with Adam from Little Monster Media for many years, so it's always nice when he gets in touch with another job for me. Little Monster Media needed me to riff on my <a href="/movie-trailer-voice" target="_blank" title="Movie Trailer Voiceover">movie trailer voice</a> while reading their really funny script. Adam wanted to advertise LMM's complete radio imagining and SFX package and I LOVE how quirky and fun the finished product is. You can check out my <a href="/voiceover-imaging" target="_blank" title="Radio Imaging Voiceover">radio imagine service</a>, if you're interested, and you may like to listen to a few of my other movie trailer voiceovers, such as my <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lw3_DUx5jrk" target="_blank" title="Rocket and Groot Voiceover" rel="noopener noreferrer">Rocket and Groot</a> and <a href="/turtle-strike-voiceover" target="_blank" title="Turtle Strike Voiceover">Turtle Strike</a> videos!</p>7:["slug","little-monster-media-movie-voice","d"]
