ler voice for Little Monster Media's big radio imaging and SFX promotion video this year. Click on the link for more!\",\"uploadDate\":\"2018-08-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Movie trailer - Little Monster Media"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A punchy movie trailer voice with a lot of impact!</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Cncd3VgDQ9s","title":"Movie trailer - Little Monster Media","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/little-monster-media-movie-voice.jpg","alt":"little-monster-media-movie-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about Little Monster Media</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://littlemonstermedia.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Little Monster Media\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Little Monster Media</a> is an audio production company based in Bristol. They have years of experience and accolades to their name and htey specialise in creating \"cutting-edge radio imaging FX and sound design for radio, TV, and online.\" Little Monster Media is a great company and it was a pleasure, as always, to work with them. It's a big compliment when an audio production company asks you to do the voiceover work for their big advertisement and it was great to work with Adam and the others at Little Monster Media. I wish them all the best with this promotion!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you need my movie trailer voice for your next <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">radio ad</a>? If you do, I'd be more than happy to hear from you, so please feel free to\r\n<a href=\"/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. If you need to hear a little more of my voice before you make a commitment, I'll be more than happy to send over a sample of your script, free of charge.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Movie trailer - Little Monster Media","pageUrl":"little-monster-media-movie-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","570",{"href":"/rac-car-passport-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/rac-car-passport.jpg","alt":"RAC Car Passport Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"RAC Car Passport Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L4","788",{"href":"/why-use-a-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/why-use-a-voiceover.jpg","alt":"why-use-a-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",nu